    "body": "/cc @mstensho and @bzbarsky as I see you were involved in #2756.\r\n\r\nMy guess is that display: contents is not the right CSS property to trigger this; instead position: relative or appearance: none or reset: all or something. (Also, please don't call it legacy: it's very much purposeful behavior.) Curious to hear what CSS spec and implementer folks think though.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
